  "version": 1,
  "title": "Stability of planar fronts in reaction-diffusion systems",
  "abstract": "A Lean formalization of effective dynamics near spectrally stable planar fronts in reaction-diffusion systems under small, bounded uniformly continuous perturbations. The main result constructs global solutions and approximates the perturbed front by a phase evolving according to a viscous Hamilton-Jacobi equation, with a uniform quantitative error bound.",
